WEBVTT

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.910
This photo was taken seven years ago.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:22.910
Were they the ones who attacked the Mototsumitama in Okinawa?

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.750
It's too dangerous.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.130
If my brother is the one after their Reiseki...

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.010
Why is Kuro's brother trying to destroy the Reiseki?

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.510
Does this have something to do with them producing Master Roots?

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:41.270
Can a Sub like me prevent them from destroying the world?

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.820
Akane-san, you should sleep in your bed.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:00.410
I'm okay, Grandpa...

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:05.040
I believe in Keita-kun

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:14.130
"Shadow of Mother"

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.800
What are you going to Okinawa for?

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:15.010
Something that only I can do awaits me there.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:18.180
You're delaying the search for my Sub again?

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.050
Be a bit more patient.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.560
It's just a matter of time before we find your Sub.

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:26.520
Am I really a Root?

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:28.770
Of course.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:32.940
Then why must I live a life hidden away?

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:37.610
The CEO of the Kaionji Group just doesn't want anything to happen to you.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:38.700
You're lying.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.790
Father is just locking me away because I'm not a Master Root.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:48.290
My siblings were given companies to manage after they became Master Roots.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.420
Hurry up and find her!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.500
The one who looks like me!

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.670
Yeah, I will.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.340
Once I've become a Master Root,

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:03.680
I'll have the Kaionji Group join the plutocracy of the world.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:08.480
I'll show my siblings what I'm capable of and make Father acknowledge my abilities.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:15.480
Yuki, this is also one of the reasons why I'm going to Okinawa.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.110
Wait for me.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.700
I'll definitely come for you.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.490
Reishin...

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:26.290
I'm reluctant to part with you, but it's better for you to go home now.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.210
We have some unwanted guests here.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:35.420
Reishin seems to still be in that building.

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.220
Reishin-sama...

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.510
Don't show him mercy just because you know him!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.140
Let's hurry.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.730
It looks like they plan to welcome us.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:04.990
W-Wait a minute.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.000
We came to attack them and yet we got surrounded?!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.750
Nah, this is an insignificant number of people.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.750
It's insignificant indeed.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.180
Steiner, head off first.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.140
Bernhard, I'll leave this place to you.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.720
Hurry!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.310
Yakumo, hurry up, too!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.700
Shishigami Reishin, I presume?

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:42.990
The Noble One?

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.490
Thanks for coming here all the way from Europe.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.620
Steiner from the German High Council.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.830
I've heard about how strong you are.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.620
I feel honored.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.840
Yakumo, you survived?

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.420
Take Kuro with you and return to the pure land.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:00.590
Or else, you too will-

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.630
Reishin-sama, why are you doing this?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.890
You even killed your own mother, the Maiden...

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.470
You have caused Kuro-sama to suffer greatly.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.810
She came to the human world alone, just to chase after you!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:19.320
Shishigami Reishin, as a Mototsumitama, you're supposed to maintain the balance of coexistence.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.690
Yet, you're disrupting the flow of Tera.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.530
We can't overlook this.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.450
Tell me your reason and intention for doing this.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:30.910
You entered the Kaionji Group and are mass producing Master Roots.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:34.580
There is no need to tell us the idealized fables you tell the humans.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:41.550
You're talking to me based on the assumption that you're right and that I'm wrong.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.800
There's no need for me to explain to people like you.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.050
What?!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.970
If I have to make a statement, then let's just say that I want to destroy the world.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:54.060
You're planning to rule the world by using the Master Roots?

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:58.810
You people, who are investigating these matters, will probably also cease to exist in the new world.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.190
New world?

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:02.530
Are you implying that you're the Creator?

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.320
You wish to become God?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:07.320
I will not be the <i>true</i> God.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:08.570
Who is it, then?!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.580
Young one, you are playing with Tera and the lives of people!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.330
I can't allow someone like you to become the Creator of the world.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:25.170
Through all this time, I've had random encounters with many Mototsumitama.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:29.220
I have yet to see Tera flow as wildly and violently as yours.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:34.470
Basically, you're saying that I'm the strongest Mototsumitama.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:51.740
Synchro!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.500
Let me test your power.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.510
Go!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:16.600
You're swift and strong.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.850
It isn't a fight if you keep dodging.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.860
Nor will it be one if I took a direct hit from one of those, right?

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.730
Want to try it?

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:27.610
Sorry, but I don't have the time for that now.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.080
He has that much power without performing synchro?!

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.260
It's going to be a pain to clean up.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.390
The helicopter is ready.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:53.220
Okay.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.720
Take care of the rest.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:55.510
Yes, Sir!

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:05.520
You are indeed powerful.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.280
But it wasn't enough to breach my Hex Wall.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.090
Synchro!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.220
A waste of time.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:39.350
Leave this to me.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:42.480
Exceed, Stampede!

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.490
We're going after Reishin!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:13.930
Reishin-sama...

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:17.010
Dammit, he got away!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.260
Oh well.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:22.390
We were able to find out what kind of person was behind the disruption of the Tera.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.980
Just what is he up to?

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:26.860
I don't know.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:31.900
But it's clear that he'll bring chaos and destruction to the world.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.400
Shishigami Reishin.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.870
An unfathomable man.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.460
I want to become someone filled with Tera as soon as possible.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:48.840
Reishin, I'll definitely form a contract with you.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.130
Good work, Raiga.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.640
It looks like Reishin-sama will arrive here tomorrow.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.930
With that, all the pieces are in place.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:05.390
I never imagined that a day like this would arrive.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.230
You know about the Doppeliner system?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:13.820
Yes.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:19.200
The mother of a friend saw someone who looked like her and died the next day.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.960
I started to conduct various investigations after that.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:30.710
I discovered that there are three people in the world who look the same.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:36.300
Two will die and the one who survives will gain a lot of luck.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:44.980
Those who survived, one after another, all became employed at the Kaionji Group, which suddenly expanded at an alarming rate.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:52.480
After that, the Kaionji group prospered further and the subsidiaries of the group began to develop a surveillance system.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.950
It was done to find people who look the same, right?

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:03.330
I received reports that someone hacked into our systems, but we weren't able to find the culprit.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:04.740
Were you the one behind it?

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.750
What do you want?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.960
Am I a Root or a Sub?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.840
You aren't afraid?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:21.140
It's more frightening to just wait, rather than to know your fate outright.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.560
Even if you're a Sub?

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.520
If that's the case...

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:32.020
You want to survive even if you have to kill the Root?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:42.410
Help me out with my plan after you've become a Master Root.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.530
I'll be glad to.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:52.420
I thought he wanted the Mototsumitama and the Master Roots to cooperate together to create an ideal world.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:56.000
But that was just a farce.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:11:02.390
Reishin-sama wanted to destroy the Reiseki and throw the world into chaos.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.350
And he'll kill those who refuse to submit to him.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.220
Like what he did to my clan...

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:12.520
Raiga, is what I'm doing betrayal?

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:15.230
No, it's punishment.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:20.950
Punishment for the man who intends to rule the world.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.370
There are five crucial points to Ryuukuu Karate.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.620
To be flexible like a willow tree: Muchimi.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.380
The ability to expand and contract your muscles freely: Chinkuchi.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.420
Speedy techniques: Fesa.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.050
Pinpoint destruction: Atifa.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.420
The most important is: Kukku.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:43.010
The power of your soul.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.140
Okay!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.930
Mother?

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.850
No, Mother's Root?

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:43.110
Don't tell me... You're the kid from back then?

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.120
Do you remember me?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.410
You're a Master Root, right?

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:56.880
You knew about the Doppeliner system?

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.880
There are things that I want to ask you.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.880
That's why I came to Okinawa.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:05.340
Were you in Okinawa seven years ago?

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.510
This is a picture of you, right?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.680
Why did you do this?

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:19.650
I was brought here to fight against the Mototsumitama from this island.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.650
Have you made a contract?

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.780
Yes.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:29.160
You were under surveillance by the Kaionji Group after you became a Master Root.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.160
Did you form a contract with a Mototsumitama after that?

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.540
Sorry.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.960
Your mother was my Sub, right?

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.180
I'm really sorry.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:54.180
She might still be alive if she hadn't met me that day.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:00.940
Sorry. I said something out of line.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:02.940
It's okay.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:09.160
Even here, there are people who are suffering because of the Doppeliner system.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.660
You poor thing...

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:23.420
Hey, let's get that powerful sis to protect us.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.970
Kakuma, we'll just end up running away if this goes on.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:36.770
Raiga!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.230
You survived?

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.230
Raiga!

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:48.240
Makana!

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.900
What are you do-

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.660
Here you go.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.040
Akane-chan, you're good at cooking.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.950
You'll be a good wife.

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.540
Oh gosh, Grandpa.

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.250
I'm not ready to get married yet.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.130
Oh no!

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:10.340
Sorry.

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:13.680
By the way, where did Keita-kun go?

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.260
I'll go and look for him.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.480
Keita-san!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.150
Sis!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.150
Kakuma was kidnapped!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.990
By whom?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.240
By...

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:35.120
Anyway, please save Kakuma!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.160
Okay, let's go!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:43.920
Kuro-sama, I ended up following you and arriving here.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:47.960
I won't let anyone get in my way this time.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.050
Hiyou...

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:03.650
It was him!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:06.440
He was the one who destroyed my clan!

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.150
Damn you!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:10.570
Makana!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:19.330
Princess, please come with me obediently if you want to save her.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:22.250
Stop this, Hiyou!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:29.800
Shall I tell you what happened to your contractee?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.340
He's just an empty husk now.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.730
We're finally alone.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.730
Kuro-sama.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.740
W-What's wrong?

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.160
What's happening....?

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:08.210
My strength... is being drained away...

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.510
What are you doing?

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.470
I'm draining away your Tera.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:21.180
You're a Sub, aren't you?

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:23.930
It probably won't take long to drain all of it away.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:33.030
Both the mother and the child were Subs. How unlucky.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:38.610
Oh my, stop resisting.

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:42.040
You'll only suffer longer if you do.

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:49.920
Keita-san!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:59.930
Are you awake, Princess?

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.100
Hiyou!

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:04.560
I've always wanted to see it.

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:10.230
You, who are headstrong and stubborn, beg in tears for my forgiveness.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.320
Hiyou, stop this!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.600
Impossible!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.720
He shouldn't be able to move anymore!

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:49.980
Kuro...

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:54.230
Are you planning to go to your contractor in your current state?

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:58.240
You know what will happen to a contracted Sub when they fight, right?

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:02.990
You'll go despite knowing that?

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:07.910
Yeah.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:12.250
Because... I'm her contractee.

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:15.710
I see.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:17.760
But...

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.800
There's no way I'll let you go.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:31.270
What?

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.650
Get out of the way.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.540
Hiyou...

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.500
I can smell the scent of your sweat.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:01.130
What a fragrant smell, Kuro-sama.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.390
Kuro...

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:14.230
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:32.410
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:32.410
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:43.840
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:43.840
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:56.230
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:56.230
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:12.620
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:12.620
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.710
Sorry to have kept you waiting, Reishin-sama.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.630
We've obtained the key to the sacred precincts.

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.340
As expected from you.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:27.890
Even though we destroyed the clan seven years ago, we didn't even know of the key's existence.

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:33.390
"The End"

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:33.560
The fate of the world is soon going to change greatly.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:38.730
This land will soon be engulfed by chaos and destruction.
